OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of new social homes
OL,4,Apromised for region
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 3,000 social and affordable
OL,7,Fhomes are going to be built in the West
OL,8,FMidlands after the region was given
OL,9,F#409m by the government.
OL,11,FThe West Midlands' mayor said the money
OL,12,Fwould be used along with his own
OL,13,Fhousing funds to build thousands more
OL,14,Fhomes that were affordable for local
OL,15,Fpeople.
OL,17,FRichard Parker said nearly 15,000
OL,18,Fchildren in the region were living in
OL,19,Ftemporary accommodation and he wanted
OL,20,Fthat number "coming down quickly".
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
