OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of new social homes
OL,4,Apromised for region
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I believe people deserve better and we
OL,7,Fwill change that by giving people the
OL,8,Fhousing stability and security they
OL,9,Fneed to get on in life," he added.
